WEBVTT

00:00:01.050 --> 00:00:02.970
Go put it back where you found it.

00:00:03.230 --> 00:00:04.930
We didn't take him.

00:00:04.930 --> 00:00:06.920
What's the problem, Satsuki?

00:00:06.920 --> 00:00:08.560
I like turtles.

00:00:08.560 --> 00:00:09.140
Kiri...

00:00:09.140 --> 00:00:11.250
Turtles sure are thoughtful.

00:00:11.250 --> 00:00:13.250
They come with a pot <i>and</i> a lid.

00:00:14.370 --> 00:00:16.570
Allow me to explain.

00:00:16.570 --> 00:00:18.570
Would you please put me down?

00:00:18.570 --> 00:00:19.370
Okay.

00:00:19.370 --> 00:00:20.330
Here.

00:00:25.320 --> 00:00:29.280
If you wouldn't mind, would you 
kindly flip me over, please?

00:00:29.640 --> 00:00:31.480
What are you trying to accomplish?

00:01:52.590 --> 00:02:02.010
<b>Konohana Kitan</b>

00:02:12.860 --> 00:02:16.990
<b>Episode 9:
Evanescent...</b>

00:02:16.990 --> 00:02:18.730
What's the deal with this turtle?

00:02:18.730 --> 00:02:21.190
Yun-tan brought him here.

00:02:21.380 --> 00:02:25.650
I was sunbathing at the shore, when...

00:02:26.430 --> 00:02:28.320
You slow turtle!

00:02:28.320 --> 00:02:29.760
Let's drag him away.

00:02:29.760 --> 00:02:31.110
Stop that, please!

00:02:32.100 --> 00:02:34.940
Y-You're hurting the turtle.

00:02:34.940 --> 00:02:36.090
Please stop!

00:02:40.140 --> 00:02:42.100
This fox is a klutz.

00:02:42.100 --> 00:02:43.760
She totally is.

00:02:42.100 --> 00:02:43.760
Please stop!

00:02:43.760 --> 00:02:45.560
Hey, face this way.

00:02:53.510 --> 00:02:56.420
Oh, crap! She's legit trying to kill us!

00:02:56.420 --> 00:02:58.310
She's got serious eyes!

00:02:58.560 --> 00:03:00.650
Thank you very much!

00:03:00.650 --> 00:03:02.910
You've saved my life.

00:03:02.910 --> 00:03:05.780
Could you please remove the rope, as well?

00:03:08.510 --> 00:03:11.150
And this is the wound from 
when I was shattered.

00:03:11.150 --> 00:03:14.220
I'm sorry our young ones have 
caused you so much trouble.

00:03:14.780 --> 00:03:16.420
Th-The bell's missing!

00:03:16.990 --> 00:03:20.130
Nonetheless, they've saved me.

00:03:20.130 --> 00:03:26.100
I'd like to invite the two of them 
to the shrine of the sea god.

00:03:26.100 --> 00:03:29.050
Do you mean Ryugu Castle?

00:03:30.190 --> 00:03:33.420
Lucky! I want to go to Ryugu Castle, too!

00:03:33.420 --> 00:03:37.020
Would you like to go in my place, then?

00:03:37.570 --> 00:03:38.710
Really?

00:03:38.710 --> 00:03:41.730
Yes, if it will make you happy.

00:03:41.740 --> 00:03:44.410
I don't know how to say this,

00:03:44.410 --> 00:03:48.700
but I don't think I have the strength 
to take anyone heavier than Yuzu-san.

00:03:49.390 --> 00:03:52.660
Not the wound! Not the wound!

00:03:50.750 --> 00:03:52.310
Who are you calling heavy?!

00:03:52.310 --> 00:03:56.330
It's all right. Girls are cuter 
with a little meat on them.

00:03:58.410 --> 00:04:00.410
You're supposed to deny that!

00:04:00.410 --> 00:04:02.830
Well, then, let's go.

00:04:02.830 --> 00:04:04.590
To the sea god's shrine!

00:04:04.590 --> 00:04:06.460
Here we go.

00:04:22.940 --> 00:04:24.080
Yuzu!

00:04:24.080 --> 00:04:25.250
Sakura-chan!

00:04:25.850 --> 00:04:30.620
Urashima-san and Yamasachihiko-san 
had no trouble free diving.

00:04:30.620 --> 00:04:33.650
Urashima-san's got some 
serious lung capacity.

00:04:34.670 --> 00:04:36.880
Is Yamasachihiko-sama the one

00:04:36.880 --> 00:04:41.380
who went to the sea when he lost 
Umisachihiko-sama's fish hook?

00:04:41.380 --> 00:04:45.760
I took him to the sea god's shrine.

00:04:46.360 --> 00:04:50.670
But in the book I read, 
the god of tides made a boat for him.

00:04:52.100 --> 00:04:53.800
I'm surprised you know about that.

00:04:53.800 --> 00:04:57.350
I read Kojiki at Bikuni-sama's place.

00:04:57.350 --> 00:05:01.650
Yamasachihiko-sama was born in a huge ship.

00:05:01.650 --> 00:05:04.060
I bet he'd be fine underwater.

00:05:04.860 --> 00:05:06.950
He's one of the gods said to have been

00:05:06.950 --> 00:05:10.280
birthed by Konohanasakuyahime-sama, 
who set fire to the midwife's home.

00:05:10.290 --> 00:05:12.620
They were born just fine in the flames.

00:05:12.620 --> 00:05:14.250
They're <i>definitely</i> your kids!

00:05:14.250 --> 00:05:16.260
I'm sorry for doubting you.

00:05:16.790 --> 00:05:19.950
But this isn't the sea. It's a pond.

00:05:19.950 --> 00:05:22.420
How do you plan to get 
to the sea god's shrine?

00:05:22.420 --> 00:05:25.000
Come on, Nacchan, the turtle's not <i>that</i>—

00:05:26.420 --> 00:05:28.860
Why do you look like you just realized that?

00:05:28.860 --> 00:05:30.070
This is stupid.

00:05:30.070 --> 00:05:31.480
Let's get back to work.

00:05:37.470 --> 00:05:40.230
Would you at least come 
to the shore with me?

00:05:40.230 --> 00:05:43.720
I'm sorry, but I need to return to work.

00:05:45.350 --> 00:05:47.940
Sakura-chan is bored now, too.

00:05:48.150 --> 00:05:49.670
Work?

00:05:49.670 --> 00:05:55.200
Oh, you wouldn't have to work at the shrine.

00:05:55.200 --> 00:05:58.670
Do you mean there's no work?

00:05:58.670 --> 00:06:00.490
Yes, that's right.

00:06:00.490 --> 00:06:02.660
You could spend every day having fun.

00:06:04.630 --> 00:06:06.020
That's...

00:06:07.910 --> 00:06:12.250
I wouldn't know what to do 
with myself every day.

00:06:12.830 --> 00:06:17.290
Konohanatei has new guests every day.

00:06:18.020 --> 00:06:22.910
Each one of them teaches 
me something important.

00:06:23.390 --> 00:06:27.210
I haven't offered them enough hospitality yet.

00:06:28.390 --> 00:06:36.010
So I'm sorry, but I can't leave Konohanatei.

00:06:39.990 --> 00:06:41.180
What?

00:06:41.180 --> 00:06:42.290
Nothing.

00:06:42.290 --> 00:06:45.130
I see. That's a shame.

00:06:45.130 --> 00:06:49.520
I was looking forward to having 
a new guest. It's been so long.

00:06:49.520 --> 00:06:50.610
Yuzu.

00:06:53.540 --> 00:06:55.760
He's come a long way to get here.

00:06:55.760 --> 00:06:57.840
Invite him inside.

00:06:58.710 --> 00:07:00.930
Okay, you're right.

00:07:00.930 --> 00:07:02.210
Yuzu-chan...

00:07:02.210 --> 00:07:03.820
That sounds good.

00:07:03.820 --> 00:07:05.240
You, too, Nacchan?

00:07:08.750 --> 00:07:12.650
Welcome to Konohanatei, sir.

00:07:14.860 --> 00:07:16.820
Aww!

00:07:17.650 --> 00:07:22.500
I apologize for the inconvenience, but we ask 
that you wash off the dirt before you enter.

00:07:22.500 --> 00:07:23.780
Pardon me.

00:07:24.390 --> 00:07:27.910
This perfume oil is effective 
for removing the ocean smell.

00:07:27.910 --> 00:07:29.500
How embarrassing.

00:07:30.430 --> 00:07:34.730
Finally, please rub your 
whole body with salt.

00:07:38.840 --> 00:07:42.770
<i>Wait... Are they marinating me?</i>

00:07:52.360 --> 00:07:54.590
I just remembered some important business!

00:07:54.590 --> 00:07:57.310
Thank you for having me!

00:07:56.360 --> 00:07:57.310
Turtle?

00:07:59.790 --> 00:08:01.750
<b>Konohanatei</b>

00:08:00.640 --> 00:08:04.270
Turtle-san went home in a hurry.

00:08:04.270 --> 00:08:07.200
You can't bring in such weird people.

00:08:08.800 --> 00:08:14.310
We ask for reservations here, 
even from dignitaries.

00:08:14.310 --> 00:08:16.160
I-I'm sorry.

00:08:20.340 --> 00:08:22.070
You there, fox...

00:08:22.070 --> 00:08:23.060
Yes?

00:08:23.650 --> 00:08:25.190
Welcome.

00:08:26.290 --> 00:08:28.580
Bring me Kiri or the okami, please.

00:08:29.100 --> 00:08:32.720
Um, are you a guest with a reservation?

00:08:32.720 --> 00:08:34.940
I have no reservation.

00:08:36.940 --> 00:08:40.900
Being with Yuzu-chan really throws me off.

00:08:40.900 --> 00:08:42.770
Hey, Ren-chan!

00:08:42.770 --> 00:08:43.440
What?

00:08:43.440 --> 00:08:46.620
There's a guest without a reservation...

00:08:46.920 --> 00:08:49.330
Look, we're busy today.

00:08:49.330 --> 00:08:53.700
If they don't have a reservation, 
send them... away...

00:08:57.760 --> 00:08:59.010
<b>Konohanatei</b>

00:08:59.370 --> 00:09:02.000
Tell them Awanami is here. 
They'll understand.

00:09:02.000 --> 00:09:03.470
I have a permit.

00:09:03.470 --> 00:09:05.810
Awanami-sama, correct?

00:09:05.810 --> 00:09:06.970
One moment, please.

00:09:08.690 --> 00:09:11.690
I apologize for the disrespect, Awanami-sama.

00:09:11.690 --> 00:09:13.700
I'll fetch the head attendant at once.

00:09:13.700 --> 00:09:14.880
It's fine.

00:09:14.880 --> 00:09:16.120
I'm tired.

00:09:16.120 --> 00:09:17.910
I'll be waiting inside.

00:09:17.910 --> 00:09:19.040
Y-Yes.

00:09:24.830 --> 00:09:28.920
Um... Who was that person?

00:09:29.640 --> 00:09:32.840
She's one of the highest gods, you dunce!

00:09:33.530 --> 00:09:34.780
Oh, shoot!

00:09:34.780 --> 00:09:36.570
Okami's out on business right now.

00:09:36.570 --> 00:09:38.790
I have to let Kiri-neesama know.

00:09:40.950 --> 00:09:43.040
Awanami-sama's here?

00:09:43.040 --> 00:09:44.480
Without any advance notice?

00:09:44.480 --> 00:09:47.550
She always shows up out of nowhere.

00:09:47.550 --> 00:09:48.970
What should we do?

00:09:48.970 --> 00:09:51.440
We already have guests 
with prior reservations.

00:09:51.670 --> 00:09:53.840
Satsuki's out running errands.

00:09:53.840 --> 00:09:54.640
Oh, no.

00:09:55.220 --> 00:09:59.840
Normally, Okami or I tend to the VIP rooms...

00:10:01.230 --> 00:10:02.110
Ren.

00:10:02.110 --> 00:10:03.120
Yes?

00:10:03.120 --> 00:10:05.430
I'm going to ask you to take
care of Awanami-sama.

00:10:08.090 --> 00:10:10.810
<i>I'm filling in for the head attendant?</i>

00:10:11.540 --> 00:10:14.490
Yes, I'd be glad to.

00:10:16.400 --> 00:10:21.120
I'm sure you'll be lonely working by yourself, 
so Yuzu, you're going to help her out.

00:10:21.120 --> 00:10:21.970
Okay.

00:10:21.970 --> 00:10:23.520
I'm counting on you.

00:10:23.920 --> 00:10:26.520
Let's work hard, Ren-chan.

00:10:27.430 --> 00:10:30.950
I'm sure you're busy with your own work.

00:10:30.950 --> 00:10:33.400
I can handle this by myself.

00:10:33.400 --> 00:10:39.170
Thanks for the thought, but my work 
today is to help you, Ren-chan.

00:10:39.170 --> 00:10:40.650
Don't worry.

00:10:40.650 --> 00:10:42.120
<i>I'm nothing but worried.</i>

00:10:49.280 --> 00:10:51.800
The little foxes from earlier?

00:10:51.800 --> 00:10:53.940
I've heard about you from Kiri.

00:10:54.240 --> 00:10:55.840
My name is Ren.

00:10:55.840 --> 00:10:59.720
I'll be serving you today in 
place of the head attendant.

00:10:59.720 --> 00:11:01.210
M-My name is Yuzu.

00:11:01.520 --> 00:11:04.210
Allow me to wash your back, Awanami-sama.

00:11:05.250 --> 00:11:06.940
Please do.

00:11:09.600 --> 00:11:11.420
Do you not have a louffah?

00:11:11.770 --> 00:11:13.200
A louffah brush?

00:11:13.200 --> 00:11:14.140
I'll fetch it.

00:11:15.900 --> 00:11:17.640
I can't find it!

00:11:18.270 --> 00:11:20.600
Here you go.

00:11:21.110 --> 00:11:23.240
Yuzu-chan, I'll handle this.

00:11:23.240 --> 00:11:24.680
Go clean up or something.

00:11:24.680 --> 00:11:25.830
But...

00:11:25.830 --> 00:11:28.870
I'm telling you not to 
give me any more trouble!

00:11:28.870 --> 00:11:30.320
Sorry.

00:11:30.330 --> 00:11:34.210
<b>Reserved</b>

00:11:35.990 --> 00:11:39.030
Hey, what's up, Yun-tan?

00:11:39.030 --> 00:11:41.280
Did you mess up and get kicked out again?

00:11:47.310 --> 00:11:49.240
Oh, I see.

00:11:49.920 --> 00:11:54.190
Ren's dream has always been 
to serve a high-ranking god.

00:11:54.630 --> 00:11:57.070
She's just really eager.

00:11:57.070 --> 00:12:01.110
Is Awanami-sama that great?

00:12:01.110 --> 00:12:02.940
She's in myths, too.

00:12:02.940 --> 00:12:07.430
Like in that Koji-whatever you were 
talking about when the turtle was here.

00:12:07.950 --> 00:12:09.940
You mean Kojiki?

00:12:09.940 --> 00:12:10.830
That's the one.

00:12:11.090 --> 00:12:15.300
So she's Awanaminokami 
from the Kamiumi myth?

00:12:15.290 --> 00:12:18.250
<b>Konohanatei</b>

00:12:16.010 --> 00:12:18.250
She's here unannounced again, huh?

00:12:19.670 --> 00:12:22.730
I let Ren handle her, 
since you weren't here.

00:12:22.730 --> 00:12:25.730
I'm sure Ren can serve her well enough.

00:12:26.430 --> 00:12:27.550
Okiku.

00:12:29.030 --> 00:12:31.680
Awanami-sama is here today.

00:12:31.680 --> 00:12:34.620
Don't be wandering around too much.

00:12:34.620 --> 00:12:36.730
Wandering around? How rude.

00:12:36.730 --> 00:12:39.060
Is Awanami-sama <i>that</i> important?

00:12:39.310 --> 00:12:40.890
Of course.

00:12:40.890 --> 00:12:43.770
Awanami-sama is the goddess 
of water bubbles.

00:12:43.770 --> 00:12:46.050
Her husband is Awanaginokami-sama.

00:12:46.050 --> 00:12:51.670
She's the granddaughter of Izanami-sama and 
Izanagi-sama, who birthed this nation.

00:12:52.180 --> 00:12:55.050
<i>She has such beautiful, porcelain skin.</i>

00:12:55.050 --> 00:12:59.770
<i>She really is like the bubbles 
that she rules over.</i>

00:13:04.300 --> 00:13:07.550
<i>Wait... Did I ever use soap?</i>

00:13:07.550 --> 00:13:09.490
I'm in heaven.

00:13:09.490 --> 00:13:10.520
That's the spot.

00:13:10.520 --> 00:13:12.580
Scrub harder, please.

00:13:12.580 --> 00:13:13.800
O-Okay!

00:13:17.550 --> 00:13:19.720
I can't see anything through the bubbles.

00:13:19.720 --> 00:13:22.150
I'm going to rinse you down for now.

00:13:32.970 --> 00:13:34.260
What's wrong, Ren?

00:13:36.660 --> 00:13:39.180
Awanami-sama...

00:13:55.460 --> 00:13:56.770
What just...

00:13:56.770 --> 00:13:58.970
Yuzu-chan, she flew your way!

00:13:59.580 --> 00:14:00.680
Okay.

00:14:03.350 --> 00:14:06.950
I squished a god!

00:14:07.660 --> 00:14:09.870
There's even more now!

00:14:09.870 --> 00:14:12.450
Please don't fly away, Awanami-sama.

00:14:12.450 --> 00:14:14.670
What do we do about this?

00:14:15.430 --> 00:14:17.810
I'll go call Kiri-san.

00:14:17.810 --> 00:14:18.580
No!

00:14:19.270 --> 00:14:21.340
Please don't tell Kiri-neesama.

00:14:21.710 --> 00:14:23.710
She trusted me to do this.

00:14:23.710 --> 00:14:25.560
I'll figure something out myself.

00:14:26.140 --> 00:14:29.260
But what?

00:14:30.160 --> 00:14:31.580
She got outside!

00:14:31.580 --> 00:14:33.730
We won't catch her if the 
wind blows her away!

00:14:37.580 --> 00:14:38.970
I'll handle things outside.

00:14:39.350 --> 00:14:41.900
You catch the mini-nami-samas in here.

00:14:42.850 --> 00:14:44.430
Now we're partners in guilt.

00:14:44.430 --> 00:14:45.610
Nacchan...

00:14:47.810 --> 00:14:49.450
W-We're partners in guilt.

00:14:49.450 --> 00:14:52.020
We can help, Yuzu-chan.

00:14:52.020 --> 00:14:54.020
Now we're partners in guilt.

00:14:54.020 --> 00:14:56.490
<i>Thanks, you two.</i>

00:14:56.500 --> 00:15:00.580
<b>Reserved</b>

00:14:57.250 --> 00:14:59.370
This is getting fun!

00:14:59.370 --> 00:15:00.590
Natsume-chan!

00:15:02.280 --> 00:15:05.540
The granddaughter of the gods 
who birthed the nation, huh?

00:15:07.340 --> 00:15:10.020
That's too much. I can't 
wrap my head around it.

00:15:17.000 --> 00:15:18.380
What is this?

00:15:27.830 --> 00:15:29.270
Yun-tan, coming your way!

00:15:29.270 --> 00:15:30.080
Got it.

00:15:32.580 --> 00:15:34.250
It's all right.

00:15:39.840 --> 00:15:42.410
Sakura-chan, what happened?

00:15:44.400 --> 00:15:45.800
Urinosuke!

00:15:45.800 --> 00:15:46.990
Okiku-chan!

00:15:46.990 --> 00:15:48.790
They're chasing me!

00:15:48.790 --> 00:15:50.590
Go away!

00:15:50.590 --> 00:15:51.870
Okiku-chan...

00:15:51.870 --> 00:15:54.960
I wonder if she's seeing things.

00:15:54.960 --> 00:15:56.210
You monster!

00:15:56.210 --> 00:15:56.970
Freak!

00:15:56.970 --> 00:15:59.550
Come any closer, and I'll haunt you!

00:15:59.930 --> 00:16:02.390
You can haunt ghosts?

00:16:02.390 --> 00:16:03.710
I don't know.

00:16:07.700 --> 00:16:09.980
Yun-tan, go after that one!

00:16:09.980 --> 00:16:10.900
Okay!

00:16:11.790 --> 00:16:14.000
Sakura, we're going to help Uri and Okiku.

00:16:14.000 --> 00:16:15.330
Bring me a net.

00:16:17.300 --> 00:16:18.210
It's too late!

00:16:18.210 --> 00:16:20.740
She's already scheming something!

00:16:23.940 --> 00:16:25.650
We're being carried away!

00:16:25.650 --> 00:16:27.740
Help!

00:16:27.740 --> 00:16:28.410
I know.

00:16:35.140 --> 00:16:36.090
There.

00:16:37.970 --> 00:16:40.530
Are you okay, Okiku-chan? Urinosuke?

00:16:40.530 --> 00:16:43.060
I'm not the least bit okay!

00:16:44.640 --> 00:16:46.760
Huh? Sakura's gone.

00:16:49.070 --> 00:16:51.230
Please wait, mini-nami-sama.

00:16:51.470 --> 00:16:53.250
You'll never beat me in tag.

00:16:53.250 --> 00:16:56.020
I grew up in the mountains. 
I have a ton of stamina.

00:17:43.330 --> 00:17:44.270
Yuzu!

00:17:49.970 --> 00:17:51.330
So heavy...

00:17:51.330 --> 00:17:52.610
Satsuki-chan!

00:17:52.890 --> 00:17:54.480
What's wrong?

00:17:54.480 --> 00:17:56.540
That's what I want to know.

00:17:56.540 --> 00:17:58.740
Get off of me!

00:17:59.010 --> 00:18:02.720
We had some spare time, 
so I came to check on you...

00:18:03.310 --> 00:18:06.390
and there you are, floating 
in the middle of the hallway.

00:18:06.680 --> 00:18:10.180
So, would you care to explain 
what this is about?

00:18:10.180 --> 00:18:11.690
Well...

00:18:14.150 --> 00:18:16.370
S-Sorry, I...

00:18:16.370 --> 00:18:17.220
Yuzu-chan.

00:18:20.470 --> 00:18:23.460
Yuzu-chan was just helping me.

00:18:23.460 --> 00:18:25.790
This was my own mistake.

00:18:25.790 --> 00:18:26.580
I'm sorry.

00:18:26.950 --> 00:18:28.540
You're spilling them!

00:18:29.470 --> 00:18:32.010
Well, I can guess what happened.

00:18:32.380 --> 00:18:36.300
Just go catch all the Awanami-samas.

00:18:36.300 --> 00:18:37.200
Okay.

00:18:38.910 --> 00:18:39.920
Yuzu-chan...

00:18:39.920 --> 00:18:40.900
Yes?

00:18:41.200 --> 00:18:46.150
I did ask you not to tell her, 
but I never asked you to take the fall for me.

00:18:46.380 --> 00:18:50.100
We might be partners in guilt, 
but that's not right.

00:18:51.220 --> 00:18:52.270
Okay.

00:18:52.270 --> 00:18:54.060
I was wrong, too.

00:18:54.530 --> 00:18:57.660
You really are an amazing girl.

00:18:57.660 --> 00:19:00.210
Stop saying embarrassing stuff like that.

00:19:03.080 --> 00:19:04.660
Hey!

00:19:04.990 --> 00:19:06.950
<b>Reserved</b>

00:19:09.270 --> 00:19:11.960
This is <i>the</i> Awanami-sama?

00:19:11.960 --> 00:19:14.930
Awanami-sama was a group guest?

00:19:14.930 --> 00:19:18.930
No, she was one guest at first, but...

00:19:20.650 --> 00:19:23.200
But how did this happen?

00:19:23.200 --> 00:19:27.180
I'm sorry. She melted because 
I scrubbed her with a louffah brush.

00:19:27.180 --> 00:19:29.390
That's impossible, silly.

00:19:29.740 --> 00:19:32.640
I'm sure Kiri would know why this happened.

00:19:33.160 --> 00:19:36.120
So where is Kiri-san?

00:19:36.920 --> 00:19:39.930
She said she was going to get 
the last mini-nami-sama.

00:19:42.200 --> 00:19:44.370
Sakura.

00:19:47.500 --> 00:19:49.200
Don't bother trying to hide her.

00:19:56.340 --> 00:19:57.300
Sakura,

00:20:00.090 --> 00:20:04.010
Awanami-sama is going through 
her rebirth right now.

00:20:05.800 --> 00:20:09.140
Just as earthly life goes 
through death and birth,

00:20:09.480 --> 00:20:14.400
gods continue their existence 
by repeating life and death.

00:20:15.680 --> 00:20:21.290
That there is Awanami-sama's 
soul, child, and memory.

00:20:21.990 --> 00:20:23.740
It's important to her.

00:20:23.740 --> 00:20:25.360
Let's give it back, okay?

00:20:33.080 --> 00:20:34.100
Okay.

00:20:34.280 --> 00:20:35.160
Okay.

00:20:43.040 --> 00:20:44.130
What's wrong?

00:20:44.130 --> 00:20:47.180
I can't stand looking at blobby things.

00:20:48.990 --> 00:20:51.130
Well, I am sorry for the trouble.

00:20:51.130 --> 00:20:55.470
If you're really sorry, 
you could have split up at home.

00:20:55.470 --> 00:21:00.800
Oh, I was taking a stroll through town, 
when I had a sudden urge.

00:21:00.800 --> 00:21:02.600
What are we, a washroom?

00:21:03.680 --> 00:21:05.840
That was so scary.

00:21:05.840 --> 00:21:08.230
You're a cursed doll. 
Why would you be scared?

00:21:08.230 --> 00:21:11.680
I had weird hallucinations 
inside the bubble.

00:21:11.680 --> 00:21:13.410
Hallucinations? Like what?

00:21:13.410 --> 00:21:16.950
I was being chased by rotten women!

00:21:18.290 --> 00:21:19.750
Hallucinations?

00:21:39.030 --> 00:21:40.690
Is something wrong, Yuzu?

00:21:41.570 --> 00:21:42.740
Ah, no.

00:21:44.430 --> 00:21:50.990
It must have been the memory of this nation 
being born, etched into Awanami-sama's soul.

00:22:01.720 --> 00:22:08.690
Our time on this world is fleeting,
 like a bubble.

00:22:08.690 --> 00:22:09.550
Huh?

00:22:09.550 --> 00:22:10.910
What are you talking about?

00:22:12.640 --> 00:22:13.880
It's a secret.

00:23:44.980 --> 00:23:49.940
<b>Next Episode: 
The Sister Strikes</b>
